---
import { SITE } from "../config";
const { nome, frequenza } = SITE.newsletter;
---
<section id="newsletter" class="box">
  <h2>{nome}</h2>
  <p class="mono freq">{frequenza}</p>
  <p>Un log di sviluppo via email. Cosa ho provato, cosa si è rotto, i numeri veri. In italiano, niente hype.</p>
  <script
    is:inline
    src="https://www.feed-letter.com/widget.js?width=100%25&buttonColor=2a793e&buttonText=Iscriviti%21&buttonPosition=below&showLabels=0&showCheckbox=1&emailPlaceholder=La+tua+email&checkboxText=Acconsento+a+ricevere+email+e+capisco+che+posso+annullare+l%27iscrizione+in+qualsiasi+momento.&borderRadius=8px&title=&subtitle=&showFirstName=0&showLastName=0&showPhoneNumber=0&firstNamePlaceholder=Nome&lastNamePlaceholder=Cognome&phonePlaceholder=Numero+di+telefono&confirmationText=Iscrizione+completata%21+Grazie%21&fontSize=14px&fontFamily=ui-sans-serif%2Csystem-ui&showSubscriberCount=0&feedId=ea20c7c7-bd1e-4560-aa22-713b946c2ba6&campaignId=ea20c7c7-bd1e-4560-aa22-713b946c2ba6"
  ></script>
</section>
<style>
  .box { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin: 40px 0; }
  .box h2 { color: var(--bg); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .box p { color: var(--bg); }
  .freq { margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .box :focus-visible { outline-color: var(--bg); }
</style>
